{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CLLocationDirection"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to true"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"north. The value "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"90"},{"type":"text","text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"180"},{"type":"text","text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changing the value of this property updates the map view immediately. If you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"want to animate the change, use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-setDirection:animated:"},{"type":"text","text":" method instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/direction","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"The heading of the map, measured in degrees clockwise from true north.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/direction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"direction","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"remoteSource":{"fi